  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">本模組以金蘋果和附魔金蘋果為靈感，加入了各種鍍金的原版食物以及附魔黃金版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要與朋友共玩的伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>正是您的最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用優惠碼「Lupin」即可享25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">本模組為原版食物添加了黃金與附魔黃金版本。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">所有食物均具備與金蘋果和附魔金蘋果相同的效果。至於黃金胡蘿蔔，其製作方式已調整為需要金錠合成。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">所有黃金食物皆需使用金錠製作，而附魔黃金食物則需透過新附魔「黃金食物附魔」取得，此附魔可在附魔台上以30級經驗值對書本進行附魔獲得。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>是否與其他添加食物的模組相容？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">目前僅相容於「原版」食物。未來我們計劃使模組能與主流食物模組新增的食品相容，雖非優先事項，但歡迎在留言區提出建議。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>如何取得附魔版本？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">只能透過獲取新附魔來製作。需具備30級經驗值，在附魔台上對書本進行附魔時憑運氣獲得該附魔。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結可享25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模組可用於模組包嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限發布於Modrinth或CurseForge平台。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，絕對不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您考慮將本模組加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們將不勝感激。如需任何調整或有疑問，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以錄製模組遊玩影片並發布於我的頻道嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，歡迎您在頻道中遊玩此模組或我們的任何模組包並製作相關影片，我們對此深表感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Golden_Foods/BH_GF_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/3/golden-foods-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/6/golden-foods-3.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1063\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></a></p>",
